<title>PAKISTAN: Karachi port handles 34,206 tonnes cargo.</title>
<headline>Karachi port handles 34,206 tonnes cargo.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan's Karachi Port Trust said it had handled 34,206 tonnes of export and import cargo in the 24 hours to 7 a.m. (0200 GMT) on Monday, compared to 75,181 tonnes in the previous 24 hours.</p>
<p>Cargo handling in tonnes:</p>
<p>					    Monday	    Previous</p>
<p>    Export cargo			18,929	    35,125</p>
<p>    Import cargo			15,277	    40,056</p>
<p>In the past 24 hours, two ships sailed and four berthed. In the next 24 hours, one ship was expected to sail and nine ships were expected to arrive.</p>
</text>
